# The DEUS toolchain: feature map

What the toolchain is, feature by feature, and what each one is made of: its spec documents, its main
definitions and its tasks ([Features.Spec](Features.Spec.mdl), D118). `deus features Toolchain.Features`
prints the tree with open tasks; `deus mdl Toolchain.Features` fails when a shipped feature still has
open work, and reports as known gaps a feature linked to nothing and unfinished work that no task tracks.

Edit it in the codebase: `deus view Toolchain.Features > f.mdl`, change it, `deus update f.mdl`.

## Extensions

| Term | URI |
| --- | --- |
| `feature` | `org.dxos.deus.feature@1.0` |

